project/environment-doubleside-interior-faces: spoint aim_sillos (and any environment map walked from INSIDE) showed missing faces when the camera was inside. ROOT CAUSE = backface culling of single-sided (FrontSide) materials, NOT a LOD bug - browser-9 confirmed all 70 sillos meshes material.side=front, geometry fully present (ModelPool baked entity). FIX: EntityLoader._forceDoubleSide(obj) sets material.side=THREE.DoubleSide+needsUpdate on every mesh, called gated to _eapp===environment in BOTH the modelPool.spawn onReady callback and the plain-GLB finalMesh path. No re-bake needed (client material override; faces always existed). Scoped to environment so placed-model uploads / props stay FrontSide (no regression). Witnessed browser-10: 70/70 sillos DoubleSide, non-env meshes unchanged.